    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>battle of wits and deception</strong>! Every word you say can decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling game with friends, <strong>no one can be trusted</strong>. Only sharp deduction and persuasive skills will lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, regular players receive a <strong>secret keyword</strong>, but the <strong>Liar</strong> does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular players must describe the keyword <strong>without revealing too much</strong>, ensuring the Liar remains unaware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the <strong>Liar</strong> must carefully listen, deduce the keyword, and blend in. Act too obvious, and you'll be caught. Stay convincing, but don\u2019t overplay your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the <strong>detective</strong> who will expose the Liar, or the <strong>master deceiver</strong> who outsmarts everyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>ultimate psychological battle</strong> now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>battle of wits and deception</strong>! Every word you say can decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling game with friends, <strong>no one can be trusted</strong>. Only sharp deduction and persuasive skills will lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, regular players receive a <strong>secret keyword</strong>, but the <strong>Liar</strong> does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular players must describe the keyword <strong>without revealing too much</strong>, ensuring the Liar remains unaware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the <strong>Liar</strong> must carefully listen, deduce the keyword, and blend in. Act too obvious, and you'll be caught. Stay convincing, but don\u2019t overplay your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the <strong>detective</strong> who will expose the Liar, or the <strong>master deceiver</strong> who outsmarts everyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>ultimate psychological battle</strong> now!</p>",
